shed"},{"surface":"மணியின்","parts":[{"text":"மணி","lemma":"மணி","gloss":"gem/sapphire"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like (comparative)"}],"gloss":"like a sapphire"},{"surface":"மாசுஅற","parts":[{"text":"மாசு","lemma":"மாசு","gloss":"dirt/blemish"},{"text":"அற","lemma":"அற","gloss":"to remove/without"}],"gloss":"flawlessly"},{"surface":"மண்ணிப்","parts":[{"text":"மண்ணிப்","lemma":"மண்ணிப்","gloss":"having washed"}],"gloss":"having washed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"புதுமை","lemma":"புதுமை","gloss":"newness"},{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"fresh flowers"},{"surface":"கஞல","parts":[{"text":"கஞலு","lemma":"கஞலு","gloss":"crowd/bind/wear closely"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to wear closely packed"},{"surface":"இன்று","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"today"}],"gloss":"today"},{"surface":"பெயரின்","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"பெயர்","gloss":"return"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"if (conditional)"}],"gloss":"if you return"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அதுமன்","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that"},{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed (emphatic particle)"}],"gloss":"that indeed"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"எம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"பரிசில்","parts":[{"text":"பரிசில்","lemma":"பரிசில்","gloss":"gift/reward"}],"gloss":"reward"},{"surface":"ஆவியர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆவியர்","lemma":"ஆவியர்","gloss":"people of Avi clan"}],"gloss":"of the Aviyar clan"},{"surface":"கோவே","parts":[{"text":"கோ","lemma":"கோ","gloss":"king"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"vocative particle"}],"gloss":"O King!"}]}],"literal":"Having crossed many mountains with waterfalls in rock caves, / and having tuned the small lute to the Cevvaḻi melody, the reason I came: / Hearing the sweet raindrops from the dark rainy sky, she who is alone, / yesterday, dwelling in a corner, experiencing deep loneliness, / the young woman, beautiful and dark-complexioned, with cool rain-like eyes streaked with red, / whose pitch-black tresses of hair have abandoned oil, / if you wash her hair flawlessly like a sapphire washed in water, / and if you return today so she can wear fresh flowers closely packed, / that indeed is our reward, O King of the Āviyar clan!","translation":"I crossed many mountains with waterfalls flowing from rock caves, and tuned my small lute to the Cevvaḻi melody. The reason I came is this: Hearing the sweet sound of rain from the dark clouds, she who is alone, yesterday, sat in a corner, filled with grief. That young woman, beautiful and dark-complexioned, with cool, red-streaked eyes, has tresses of pitch-black hair that have long abandoned oil. If you return today, wash her hair flawlessly like a polished sapphire, and let her adorn it with closely packed fresh flowers—that indeed is the only reward we seek, O King of the Āviyar clan!","modern":"குகை அருவிகளைக் கொண்ட பல மலைகளைக் கடந்து வந்து, எனது சிறிய யாழில் செவ்வழிப் பண்ணை இசைத்துப் பாடினேன். நான் இங்கு வந்ததன் நோக்கம் இதுவே: கார்மேகத்திலிருந்து பொழியும் இனிய மழையின் ஒலியைக் கேட்டு, தனியாக வருந்தி, நேற்று ஒரு மூலையில் தனிமையில் அழுதுகொண்டிருந்தாள் உமது மனைவி. சிவந்த வரிகளையுடைய குளிர்ந்த கண்களையும், அழகிய மாநிறத்தையும் கொண்ட அந்த இளம்பெண், எண்ணெய் தடவாமல் சடையோடிப் போன தன் கரிய கூந்தலை, இன்று நீர் அவளிடம் திரும்பிச் சென்று, அழுக்கு நீக்கிய நீலமணி போலத் தூய்மையாகக் கழுவி, புதிய மலர்களைச் சூட்டி மகிழ்வித்தால், அதுவே எங்களுக்கு நீர் தரும் பெரும் பரிசாகும், ஆவியர் குலக் கோவே!","explanation":"The poet Peruṅkuṉṟūr Kiḻār is addressing King Pēkaṉ of the Āviyar clan, who has abandoned his wife Kaṇṇaki for a courtesan. The poet explains that he has traveled across difficult mountain paths and played a sorrowful melody on his lute to gain the king's attention. He describes the miserable state of Pēkaṉ's wife, who sits alone in a corner weeping as she listens to the rain. Her pitch-black hair, which has gone without oil for a long time, is a traditional symbol of a pining wife's grief. The poet declares that he does not want gold or land; his only desired reward is for Pēkaṉ to return home today, wash his wife's hair until it shines like a sapphire, and adorn it with fresh flowers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.5],[3.5,4.3],[4.5,4.7],[4.7,6.08],[6.08,6.54],[6.54,6.54],[6.54,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,11.21],[11.21,11.7],[11.7,12.2],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.7],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.27],[14.63,15.0],[15.0,15.8],[15.8,16.0],[16.0,16.2],[16.2,16.9],[17.6,18.3],[18.3,18.6],[18.6,18.9],[18.9,19.1],[19.1,19.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.1],[3.1,3.2],[3.2,3.7],[3.7,4.3],[4.3,4.3],[4.3,4.3],[4.3,5.16],[5.16,5.73],[5.73,6.3],[6.3,8.3],[8.3,8.9],[8.9,9.0],[9.0,10.5],[10.5,10.5],[10.5,11.1],[11.1,11.4],[11.4,12.47],[12.47,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,15.38],[15.8,16.0],[16.0,16.7],[16.7,16.9],[16.9,17.2],[17.2,17.9],[18.6,19.2],[19.2,19.4],[19.4,19.7],[19.7,19.9],[19.9,20.5]]},"sync":[[["கல்முழை","rock cave"]],[["அருவிப்","of the waterfall"]],[["பன்மலை","many mountains"]],[["நீந்திச்","having crossed"]],[["சீறியாழ்","small lute"]],[["செவ்வழி","Cevvaḻi melody"]],[["பண்ணி","having tuned"]],[["வந்ததைக்","the purpose of coming"]],[["கார்வான்","rainy sky"]],[["இன்னுறை","sweet raindrops"]],[["தமியள்","she who is alone"]],[["கேளா","hearing"]],[["நெருநல்","yesterday"]],[["ஒருசிறைப்","in a corner"]],[["புலம்புகொண்டு","experiencing loneliness"]],[["உறையும்","who dwells"]],[["அரிமதர்","red-streaked and lustrous"]],[["மழைக்கண்","cool rain-like eyes"]],[["அம்மா","beautiful and dark-complexioned"]],[["அரிவை","young woman"]],[["நெய்யடு","with oil"]],[["துறந்த","which has abandoned"]],[["மையிருங்","pitch black"]],[["கூந்தல்","tresses of hair"]],[["மண்ணூறு","washed/polished"]],[["மணியின்","like a sapphire"